# Exclude Build Artifacts
RULE: Never type-check build/, dist/, __pycache__/, .venv/, node_modules. Add to pyrightconfig.json exclude.
WHY: Stale code causes false positives; compiled bytecode doesn't match source.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md, pyrightconfig.json
DO: exclude: ["build", "dist", "__pycache__", ".venv", ".ruff_cache"]; run basedpyright on source_dir only
NEVER: Type-check build dirs; include .venv in basedpyright scope
